==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|каранда́шъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
In Russian from the 16–17th centuries. Borrowing from a {{der|ru|trk}} language. Compare {{cog|tr|karataş||black slate}}, composed of {{m|tr|kara||black}} + {{m|tr|taş||stone}}, {{cog|tt|кара таш||graphite, black lead}}. The origin of epenthetic {{m|ru||-н-}} is unclear. Compare {{m|ru|каланча́}} for the same epenthesis.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|каранда́ш}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-карандаш.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|aʂ|s=3}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|b|каранда́ш|adj=каранда́шный|dim=каранда́шик}}

# [[pencil]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[у|У]] [[ты|тебя́]] [[есть]] '''каранда́ш'''?|Do you have '''a pencil'''?}}
# {{lb|ru|uncountable}} [[pencil]] [[mark]]s, [[pencil]] [[drawing]]
# {{lb|ru|by extension}} [[stick]] {{gl|a small, thin cylinder of some material}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[кле́ящий]] '''каранда́ш'''|[[glue stick|glue '''stick''']]}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[ля́писный]] '''каранда́ш'''|silver nitrate caustic '''stick'''}}

